        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.31+EXO.25.32+EXO.25.33+EXO.25.34+EXO.25.35+EXO.25.36+EXO.25.37+EXO.25.38+EXO.25.39+EXO.25.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuva 25.31-40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Arema ibitereko by'izahabu by'amatabaza cumi nk'uko itegeko ryabyo ryari riri, abishyira mu rusengero, bitanu iburyo n'ibindi bitanu ibumoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.23+EXO.25.24+EXO.25.25+EXO.25.26+EXO.25.27+EXO.25.28+EXO.25.29+EXO.25.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuva 25.23-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abaza n'ameza cumi ayashyira mu rusengero, atanu iburyo n'atanu ibumoso, arema n'ibyungu by'izahabu ijana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yubaka urugo rw'abatambyi, inyuma yubakaho n'urundi runini. Kandi ateraho n'inzugi ku marembo y'urugo, izo nzugi aziteraho imiringa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igikarabiro kidendeje agishyira iruhande rw'iburyo rw'inzu, iburasirazuba herekeye ikusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huramu na we acura ibisa n'ibibindi, n'ibyuma byo kuyora ivu n'ibyungu. Nuko Huramu arangiza umurimo w'inzu y'Imana yakoreraga Umwami Salomo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkingi zombi n'imperezo n'imitwe yombi yari hejuru y'inkingi, n'ibisa n'inshundura byombi byo gutwikira ahiburungushuye ho ku mitwe yombi yari hejuru y'inkingi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'imbuto z'amakomamanga magana ane zo gushyira ku bisa n'inshundura byombi, n'impushya ebyiri z'imbuto z'amakomamanga zo ku bisa n'inshundura byombi, byo gutwikira ahiburungushuye ho ku mitwe yombi yari hejuru y'inkingi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ibitereko n'ibikarabiro byari hejuru yabyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'igikarabiro kidendeje n'inka cumi n'ebyiri zari munsi yacyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ibibindi n'ibyuma byo kuyora ivu n'ibyo kwaruza inyama, ibyo byose Huramu yabikoreye Umwami Salomo ku bw'inzu y'Uwiteka, abikoze mu miringa isenwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami yabiremeshereje mu kibaya cya Yorodani mu rubumba, hagati y'i Sukoti n'i Sereda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni ko Salomo yaremye ibyo bintu byose byinshi cyane, kuremera kw'imiringa ntikwamenyekanye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salomo arema ibintu byose byari mu nzu y'Imana, n'icyotero cy'izahabu n'ameza imitsima yo kumurikwa yaterekwagaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ibitereko by'amatabaza n'amatabaza yabyo, kugira ngo yake imbere y'ubuturo bwera nk'uko itegeko ryari riri, byari iby'izahabu nziza itunganyijwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'uburabyo n'amatabaza n'ibisa n'ingarama by'izahabu, ndetse byari izahabu itunganyijwe rwose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ibifashi n'ibyungu n'indosho n'ibyotero by'izahabu nziza. Kandi umuryango w'inzu, inzugi z'imbere z'Ahera cyane n'inzugi z'inzu yitwa urusengero, byari izahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
